  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pcjx](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pcjx) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 19.149 depth occurred on Feb 10 2025 68km NW of Pango. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -17.5082 longitude 167.7436. It impacted 36 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
